      "message": "I think we should use `enum_as` from the common location,  both picking up your recent changes and making `enum_as1 available to the Ti50 build can be done in the next step, so we can leave the `enum_as` crate as is for this patch,\n\nSharing the AP RO and other enums and structures is a much more involved undertaking, this is why I suggest to duplicate them for now to be able to publish the utility quickly, and look into sharing them later to see if it is at all feasible.\n\nWDYT?",
