      "writtenOn": "2023-11-02T22:38:36Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Couldn\u0027t this just move the minimum functions necessary and have `ti50_macros` re-export the things that moved? `enum_as` as a library name is smaller in scope than what it actually defines, so I think this should either:\n\nA) rename the library to something more general, like `enum_utils`, or\nB) the non-`enum_as` methods remain where they are, this library only defines `enum_as`, and `enum_as` gets re-exported in `ti50_macros`.",
      "parentUuid": "dccf9ff5_61056c89",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 34,
        "startChar": 3,
        "endLine": 34,
        "endChar": 22
      },
