      "lineNbr": 34,
      "author": {
        "id": 1541362
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-11-02T23:50:08Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The reason I ask for it to be modified is because `enum_as` is not a good name for what the library actually defines.\n\nWill gsc-utils need to use more than `enum_as`? I\u0027m suggesting it be split or be renamed to `enum_utils` if you see gsc-utils using these other macros.\n\nWe are going to add more proc-macros that have nothing to do with enums, so the `ti50_proc_macros` crate will need to stick around long term regardless of what you do here. That\u0027s why I think it will be simpler to split out `enum_as` into its own crate and put it here, and then just re-export it from `ti50_macros`.",
      "parentUuid": "279144fa_858814ed",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 34,
        "startChar": 3,
        "endLine": 34,
        "endChar": 22
      },
      "revId": "7ebf0550144df1646ebe97dc85165b8c402d1428",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
