        "id": 1000039
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-11-03T00:02:13Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I totally understand that probably not the entire `enum_as` crate is needed for ths gsc-utils port, but the intention is to keep it the same between ti50 and gsc-utils.\n\nIt it needs to be refactored and split - so be it, but it has to be done in the ti50 space first and then the smaller part moved to gsc-util to be shared.",
      "parentUuid": "fd0d4724_f8fac098",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 34,
        "startChar": 3,
        "endLine": 34,
        "endChar": 22
